  "oracle_text": "When Wort enters, create two 1/1 red and green Goblin Warrior creature tokens.\nEach red or green instant or sorcery spell you cast has conspire. (As you cast the spell, you may tap two untapped creatures you control that share a color with it. When you do, copy it and you may choose new targets for the copy.)"
